cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VisuTwin Canvas in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VisuTwin Canvas: a GPU-native visualization runtime for digital twins and scientific computing"
abstract: >-
  A C++23 real-time rendering engine for digital twins, geospatial scenes and
  scientific visualization, running natively on Apple Metal and Vulkan 1.3.
authors:
  - family-names: Lektauers
    given-names: Arnis
    affiliation: Riga Technical University
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/visutwin/visutwin-canvas"
url: "https://canvas.visutwin.com"
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - real-time rendering
  - scientific visualization
  - physically based rendering
  - Metal
  - Vulkan
  - C++
